            0.885,
            0.446
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. What is the length of the blue line and black line shown below? The distance between 0 and 1 is 1 unit long, and it is divided into two equal parts. The length of each part is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } ."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . So the blue line "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { i s } \\frac { 1 } { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " units long. Write the fraction that gives the length of the black line in the box."
            }
          ]
